n active exposure that, if surfaced in the renewal conversation with the hospital network, could kill the company's only material contract.\n\nI would not proceed. The unit economics are structurally broken, the retention outside the anchor is negative, the team has a critical engineering leadership gap at the wrong moment, and the business is six months away from a potential existential revenue event with no committed backstop. These are not concerns that more diligence resolves \u2014 they are operational realities visible in the current data."
